    {
      "title": "Server-Side Data Access: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Server-Side Data Access: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Query in the component",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Server Components are ==async functions==",
                "`await` the DB call in the body: {red:no} API route, {red:no} `useEffect`",
                "DB code runs ==only on the server==",
                "Credentials and queries never reach the **client bundle**"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Fetch where it is used",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Query in the component that needs the data",
                "Result is serialised into the ==RSC payload==",
                "Client Components get only ==plain serialisable values=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Static or dynamic",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Component reads",
                "Rendering",
                "DB query runs"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`cookies()`, `headers()`",
                  "Dynamic",
                  "each request"
                ],
                [
                  "no request data",
                  "Static",
                  "at ==build time=="
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Parallel queries",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Independent queries: start together with ==Promise.all==",
                "Sequential `await`s create a **waterfall**"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "typescript",
              "lines": [
                "const [user, posts] = await Promise.all([",
                "  db.user.find(id),",
                "  db.post.list(id),",
                "]);"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Waterfall",
              "text": "Each `await` waits for the previous one. Total time = ==sum== of queries, not the slowest."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
